Testing comparison operations in assignments:
Integer comparisons:
  a = 5, b = 3
  door result1 = a > b: run
  door result2 = a < b: been
  door result3 = a == b: been
  door result4 = a != b: run
  door result5 = a >= b: run
  door result6 = a <= b: been
\nDecimal comparisons:
  x = 5.5, y = 3.25
  door result7 = x > y: run
  door result8 = x < y: been
  door result9 = x == y: been
  door result10 = x != y: run
\nMixed integer and decimal comparisons:
  door result11 = a > y: run
  door result12 = x == a: been
\nBoolean type assignments:
  bool isGreater = a > b: run
  bool isLess = a < b: been
  bool isEqual = a == b: been
  bool isNotEqual = a != b: run
  bool isDecimalGreater = x > y: run
\nComplex expressions:
  door complex1 = (a > b) && (a != b): run
  door complex2 = (a < b) || (a == 5): run
  door complex3 = (x > y) && (a == 5): run
\nVariable reassignment:
  Initial test value: been
  After test = a > b: run
  After test = x < y: been
